"Used as the <code>?token=</code> suffix in direct wake links, e.g. "
"<code>/cgi-bin/wolultra-wake?mac=AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF&token=…</code>"
msgstr "用作直达唤醒链接的 <code>?token=</code> 后缀，例如 <code>/cgi-bin/wolultra-wake?mac=AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF&token=…</code>"

